{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ed8QcBAsqu1794297351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>APEC領導人會議將於下周在深圳舉行，澳門明日起禁止所有無人機飛行活動，為期12天。</p><p></p><p>澳門民航局發出公告，為確保APEC領導人會議順利展開，明日至本月22日期間，禁止澳門特區範圍上空所有飛行活動，但公共商業航空運輸執行緊急救援，及警務無人機除外。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.686426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:17.686732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:17.686732+00:00","content_hash":"6f5de66527f133366ab13ae89006127abe1732895c41d69a861a4a71f7c1f531","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}